{"title":"물거품","artist":"요루시카","sourceId":"reference:F13ukibQX93iEDJy7C0R","sourceHash":"b09f5dc449b8203fc3c71102565c8a05deeaf10836d55f245f09c9068deee246","performanceStatus":"reference_timing","timingMethod":"reference_lrc_unverified","reviewStatus":"draft","cue_timing_confirmed":false,"timingWarning":"(주의) 노래와 함께 타이밍 검증되지 않았음","referenceProvider":"LRCLIB","referenceId":33051139,"cues":[{"id":"1","start":11.76,"end":14.63,"text":"あぁどうしようもないほどに","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":14.63,"end":18.24,"text":"私に蠢く獣","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":18.24,"end":29.36,"text":"水面浮かんで浮かんでは消える あぶく","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":29.36,"end":32.12,"text":"あぁどうしようもなく悲しい","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":32.12,"end":35.94,"text":"私を動かす獣","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":35.94,"end":40.73,"text":"トートロジー握った手のあぶく","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":40.73,"end":43.82,"text":"過ぎ去る雲を思うより","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":43.82,"end":46.48,"text":"遥かへ遠吠え","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":46.48,"end":49.63,"text":"息継ぐ暇もないほど","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":49.63,"end":53.47,"text":"苦しいあれで","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":53.47,"end":56.14,"text":"悠々悠々夢を焼け","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":56.24,"end":59.91,"text":"魂の白い白い色で","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":59.91,"end":65.07,"text":"喜びの火に火をつけたいだけ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":65.07,"end":67.96,"text":"想像は少しの泡銭","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":67.96,"end":71.6,"text":"冷めない言葉の両手で","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":71.6,"end":76.73,"text":"燃え尽きないものを数えて","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":76.73,"end":78.34,"text":"掬いたいだけ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":89.28999999999999,"end":92.27000000000001,"text":"さぁ 銘々ご覧遊べ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":92.27000000000001,"end":95.75999999999999,"text":"私の乾いた獣","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":95.75999999999999,"end":101.07,"text":"ふつふつ怒った音を鳴らして","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":101.07,"end":103.85,"text":"あぁろうそくの火を消して","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":103.85,"end":108.21000000000001,"text":"私に残ったものは","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":108.21000000000001,"end":112.4,"text":"滑稽なペダンチスムだけ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":112.4,"end":115.52000000000001,"text":"過ぎ去る雲にどうして","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":115.52000000000001,"end":118.25999999999999,"text":"私は遠吠え","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":118.25999999999999,"end":121.32,"text":"悲しむ暇もないほど","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":121.32,"end":125.18,"text":"悲しいあれで","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":125.18,"end":127.94,"text":"想想想像で一つだけ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":127.94,"end":131.63,"text":"寂しい私に太陽を","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":131.63,"end":136.71,"text":"喜びに火を、火をつけておくれ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":136.71,"end":139.66,"text":"焦燥も少しの泡銭","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":139.66,"end":143.28,"text":"苦しい私の両手で","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"33","start":143.28,"end":148.48,"text":"燃え尽きないものを数えて","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"34","start":148.48,"end":150.07,"text":"摘みたいだけ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"35","start":161.39,"end":164.73,"text":"半信半疑の満身創痍で尚","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"36","start":164.73,"end":166.73,"text":"太陽が欲しい","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"37","start":166.73,"end":169.81,"text":"だからもっと私に火をつけて","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"38","start":169.81,"end":173.14,"text":"吐き出して","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"39","start":173.14,"end":178.92000000000002,"text":"超能力でも創作物でも現実逃避でもいい","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"40","start":178.92000000000002,"end":181.62,"text":"もっと私に火をつけて","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"41","start":181.62,"end":185.18,"text":"私を震わせて","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"42","start":195.48,"end":198.17000000000002,"text":"夕夕夕夕夕、目を焼け","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"43","start":198.17000000000002,"end":201.74,"text":"魂の白い白い色で","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"44","start":201.74,"end":206.96,"text":"喜びの火に火をつけたいだけ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"45","start":206.96,"end":209.85,"text":"想像の頭上の上を行け","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"46","start":209.85,"end":213.57999999999998,"text":"冷めない言葉の両手で","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"47","start":213.57999999999998,"end":218.69,"text":"燃え尽きたものも全て","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"48","start":218.69,"end":220.26,"text":"掬いたいだけ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"}],"candidates":[]}